cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this software, please cite it using the
  metadata from this file.
title: "Climate Risk Assessment for Kazakhstan"
abstract: >-
  An adaptation of the CLIMAAX CRA Handbook for Kazakhstan,
  replacing European-specific datasets with globally available
  alternatives while maintaining the original scientific methodology.
  Covers climate risk assessment for droughts, heatwaves, floods,
  wildfire, and extreme precipitation across Kazakhstan's oblasts.
